# shape: Stimulus-style controllers wiring actions without an event: the default event by tag (a, button, input of each kind, textarea, select, form, details) and an element with no default
kinds=handler
@@@ file: src/index.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>

</head>
<body>
<a data-action="nav#go">a</a>
<button data-action="cart#add">b</button>
<input type="submit" data-action="f#send">
<input type="button" data-action="f#b">
<input type="reset" data-action="f#r">
<input type="text" data-action="search#query">
<textarea data-action="note#save"></textarea>
<select data-action="filter#pick"></select>
<form data-action="f#submit"></form>
<details data-action="faq#toggle"><summary>s</summary></details>
<div data-action="panel#show">p</div>
</body>
</html>
